{"parse": {"title": "TTSC-08", "pageid": 134763, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-07\" title=\"TTSC-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTSC-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-09\" title=\"TTSC-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTSC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BE.8E.E6.B4.B2.E6.BC.AB.E6.AD.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"美洲漫步\">美洲漫步</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 美洲漫步</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Roaming in America</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>传送前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>传送后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\">沿着时间与历史结构的旅行。</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/Cg-3_5_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/Cg-3_5_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/Cg-3_5_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艺术品拍卖会当晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>约定的十二点已过一刻，匪徒女士仍未露面，等候者心下越发焦躁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侧门传来“咔哒”的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我以为……算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>蝴蝶女士，您迟到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>抱歉，关键时刻，我的“好运气”总会让我遇上一些事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>曾经，我在巴塞罗那追杀——尾随一名神秘学家，她被卷入魔精爱好者的游行队伍。为了找到她，我险些被撞断一条腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>还有一次，在卡萨布兰卡，我扣下扳机，子弹将要穿过目标的那颗头颅时，石化咒在他身上显现，他的仇家先我一步将他变成了一块石头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有诚意地道歉后，她将用来撬锁的基金会徽章收起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>您的过往非常精彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>拍卖会已经开始了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>是的，宾客们俱已入场完毕了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>好极了，聚光灯对准舞台，现在正是潜入的最佳时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>但我在这栋建筑里没有听见任何的声响，这里静得跟墓地一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>拍卖会并不在这儿举行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>造假先生带领着身份不明的匪徒女士走至巨大的太阳石展品前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>西班牙人在攻陷特诺奇提特兰城后，大主教便将代表着阿兹特克文明的太阳石掩埋，以清除异教的存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>1790年，人们在整修墨西哥城的主教座堂时，在大广场的地底下重新挖掘出这块巨型石刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>相传墨西哥城大都会大教堂，正是修建在昔日阿兹特克的马约神庙之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>不要告诉我现在悬在我头上的这一块大石头，是这栋建筑里唯一的真品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你们从博物馆里把它偷出来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>哈哈，当然不是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>这不过是佩雷斯先生为俱乐部做的一些点缀罢了。当异国的买家们沉浸在“古文明”氛围中，往往出手就会变得阔绰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>我参与了这件仿制品的制作，尝试复原它复杂、斑斓的色彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>这块阿兹特克太阳石，正是拍卖会的入口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>请，蝴蝶女士。我相信您有启动它的办法。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\">沿着时间与历史结构的旅行。</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_5_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_5_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_5_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>辉光成功唤醒了面前的太阳石，它闪烁着夺目的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-645610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>传送要开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-645601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野木蓝：</div><div>请做好准备，女士。传送的过程中可能会伴随着一些神秘术的副作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313917.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-313917.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313917.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313917.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-313917.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313917.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-313917.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313917.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>我已经迫不及待要看到这个拍卖会的真面目了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_5_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_5_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_5_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜色昏暗。墓地中，彩蜡烛被点燃，一双沉静的眼睛凝视着烛光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>据我所知，拍卖会已经开始很久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>但为什么蜡烛还没起效？那个家伙不至于在这种地方开玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她罕见地感到焦躁，眉头皱起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>蜡烛快要烧光了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>这根彩蜡烛，它有什么作用？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女孩小心地伸手护住彩蜡烛的焰火，防止风让它燃得更快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-314201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-314201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-314201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>这根彩蜡烛的雕刻工艺，是一种古老的复刻术式。在《门多萨手抄本》中有记载，这种有特殊功效的神秘学工具，曾被用作神圣的贡品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-314201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-314201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-314201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>当某处的仪式开启时，只要引燃蜡烛，它就会在这里重现相同的效用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-314212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>我们只有一次机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蜡烛已接近完全融化，烛火将熄，忽明忽暗。<br />突然，以虚弱的烛火为中心，阵法显现，一阵狂风凭空而起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉莫纳：</div><div>准备好——是传送法阵！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的身体与声音也几乎被风声淹没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>啊啊啊啊啊——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>圣洛夫基金会……应该在所有的年代推广传送软盘！！！</div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<hr class=\"decroate\" /><div class=\"story no-indent\">\n<p><big class=\"serif\"><b>传送仪式内容</b></big><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>石头中的能量在……流动。就像它拥有脉搏一样。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>它连接着土地，跨越城市与山谷，蔓延向遥远的另一端。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>真是精妙。这是一个藏在里头的传送仪式法阵。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>只要使用神秘术辉光唤醒特定的符号，就能够启动它。<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"选择 &#91;&#91;File:v3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png|x20px|link=|middle|&#93;&#93;\">选择 <img alt=\"V3a5 plot puzzle icon 06.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png/21px-V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png/31px-V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png/41px-V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"138\" data-file-height=\"134\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"选择其他图标\">选择其他图标</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"选择 &#91;&#91;File:v3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png|x20px|link=|middle|&#93;&#93;\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>野木蓝：</b></span>看来您还记得邀请函上的内容。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>当然。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"选择其他图标\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>野木蓝：</b></span>您还记得邀请函上的诗句吗？<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>“神圣历与太阳历重新对齐，我们得以庆祝末日的推迟。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>“我们在星山上眺望，星座攀上天顶。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>关键是上面代表着新火仪式的“燧石刀”型符号。<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"选择 &#91;&#91;File:v3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png|x20px|link=|middle|&#93;&#93;\">选择 <img alt=\"V3a5 plot puzzle icon 06.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png/21px-V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png/31px-V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png/41px-V3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"138\" data-file-height=\"134\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"再次选择其他图标\">再次选择其他图标</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"激活轰轰吼叫匣·X\">激活轰轰吼叫匣·X</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"选择 &#91;&#91;File:v3a5_plot_puzzle_icon_06.png|x20px|link=|middle|&#93;&#93;\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>野木蓝：</b></span>看来您还记得邀请函上的内容。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>当然。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"再次选择其他图标\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>噢，看来这个图案并不是“燧石刀”。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"激活轰轰吼叫匣·X\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>很有意思的小游戏<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>但在观察神秘术辉光的流向上，洛伦兹研究所有自己的方式<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>野木蓝：</b></span>这证明您有凌驾普通规则的能力<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>轰轰吼叫匣·X：</b></span>参照物参数已建立。开始观测混沌能量方向<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>轰轰吼叫匣·X：</b></span>宾果！不对<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>轰轰吼叫匣·X：</b></span>¡Lotería<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洛伦兹蝴蝶：</b></span>我不需要你在这种时候变得智能。<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTSC-08"}}